 "_doc": [
  "새한글성경 (NKT) versification -> canonical (개역개정/ESV) numbering.",
  "Derived offline from the 1,189 cached nkt_v1_* chapters in COMMENTARY_KV,",
  "compared against VERSE_COUNTS in the app's src/data/verseCounts.ts.",
  "No bible.bskorea.or.kr traffic was involved in producing this.",
  "",
  "shift: NKT numbers the same verses N higher within the same chapter",
  "  (Hebrew counts the psalm superscription as a verse).",
  "  canonical verse V  ==  NKT verse V + offset, same chapter.",
  "",
  "review: the chapter BOUNDARY differs, so a canonical chapter is not",
  "  contained in one NKT chapter. These are NOT auto-derived: inferring",
  "  them from counts alone can silently misattribute scripture, so each",
  "  needs its span confirmed against the text before being applied.",
  "",
  "status on each review entry: repaired = canonical chapter now written to KV;",
  "no-merged-text = the pre-fix cache held nothing extra, so the missing verses",
  "  are not recoverable by prefix-splitting and the boundary is still unknown;",
  "unresolved = not yet examined (the 'long' shape, NKT has MORE verses).",
  "",
  "The 11 'no-merged-text' chapters were analysed further and carry an `analysis`",
  "block.  Three of them (출애굽기 8, 레위기 6, 욥기 41) DO hold whole extra verses",
  "in the pre-fix cache — verses the wildcard parser pulled off the same page as",
  "complete entries rather than as appended text, which the prefix splitter did",
  "not look for.  They only account for SOME of what each chapter is missing.",
  "",
  "The reason is that these boundaries run BACKWARD: canonical 욥기 41:1-8 is",
  "Hebrew 40:25-32, so the missing verses belong to the END of the previous NKT",
  "chapter, not the start of the next.  That is the opposite direction from",
  "요엘/요나, and it is why the adjacent-surplus test failed.",
  "",
  "Do not resolve these from counts.  Each needs its span read against 개역개정",
  "before anything is written.",
  "",
  "The pre-fix dump of all 1,189 chapters — the ONLY copy of the merged text, and",
  "what every repair depends on — is archived at /Users/pauljuhyenkim/krengbible-nkt-archive/nkt_all.json (12 MB).",
  "",
  "CAUTION on the 'long' chapters (NKT has MORE verses than canonical).",
  "These are NOT a 새한글 defect and must not be 'fixed'.  로마서 9 was refetched",
  "with the corrected parser and still returns 33 verses — and the ESV also has",
  "33.  The app's VERSE_COUNTS says 32.  So for these chapters it is the app's",
  "table that is short, because 개역개정 merges verses in places and the table",
  "appears to have been generated from it.",
  "",
  "That makes VERSE_COUNTS an unreliable oracle for exactly this group.  The",
  "repaired chapters are unaffected — each was reconstructed from recovered text",
  "whose verse count balanced EXACTLY against the target and was spot-checked",
  "verse-by-verse against 개역개정 — but any future work here should verify the",
  "canonical count against the ESV, not the table."
 ],
